  "details": "When users are shown as t-posing impostors, they sometimes cease transmitting network data. As a result, their in-game position remains static until their proper avatar loads. This leads to a network discrepancy where the avatar remains in a previous location while the user has actually moved elsewhere.\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/cywt7j.mp4",
